Totem Master Return Mana
    Events
        Unit - A unit Finishes casting an ability
    Conditions
        (Level of TOTEMIC_TotemMaster (Passive) for (Triggering unit)) Greater than or equal to 1
        Or - Any (Conditions) are true
            Conditions
                (Ability being cast) Equal to TOTEMIC_Channel_TotemEarth 
                (Ability being cast) Equal to TOTEMIC_Channel_TotemFire 
                (Ability being cast) Equal to TOTEMIC_Channel_TotemWater 
                (Ability being cast) Equal to TOTEMIC_Channel_TotemWind 
                (Ability being cast) Equal to TOTEMIC_Channel_TotemStoneskin 
                (Ability being cast) Equal to TOTEMIC_Channel_TotemEarthbind 
                (Ability being cast) Equal to TOTEMIC_Channel_TotemWindfury 
    Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Ability being cast) Equal to TOTEMIC_Channel_TotemEarth 
            Then - Actions
                Set VariableSet TotemManaCost = (For (Triggering unit), Mana cost of TOTEMIC_Channel_TotemEarth , Level (Level of TOTEMIC_Channel_TotemEarth  for (Triggering unit)).)
                Unit - Set mana of (Triggering unit) to ((Mana of (Triggering unit)) + (Real(TotemManaCost)))
